  "_doc": "Slice TS (docs/GATES.md \"Slice TS as built\"): the temp-dir prefixes Architect's kit and sidecar tests, runners and drivers used before TS (origin/main 799a1df4), built from their mkdtemp/tempDir calls. Only `tools/tmp-sweep.mjs --unmarked` (by hand, the one-time cleanup after Noah's OK) removes a dir WITHOUT an .arch-owner marker only when its name is one of these plus mkdtemp's 6-character suffix (or matches a pattern), and only past the no-marker age. Every other unmarked name is never touched: other tools share $TMPDIR. New dirs (arch-*, marked) need no entry. Short generic prefixes (au-, hr-, pm-, sc-, sv-, us-) are left out: other tools may share them.",
